# llama-cpp-studio ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** local control plane for managing and serving multiple engines through an OpenAI-compatible endpoint.

**LEONES status:** P1 architectural.

## Summary

llama-cpp-studio separates UI/control-plane concerns from the underlying inference engine and can manage different runtimes.

## ODS fit

This is valuable as an architectural reference for an ODS Runtime Registry and adapter layer. ODS should similarly be able to select a backend without exposing backend-specific details to applications.

**Classification:** P1 control-plane architecture reference.